Owner: Sustainability/ESG Manager
Participants: Merchandising (VS-03/VS-41), Brand Principals, Legal (VS-100), Finance
Source: workflow W5348 — Manufacturer/Brand Stewardship Partnership, Co-Funding &amp; EPR Alignment</bpmn:documentation>
