        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify brands with existing stewardship schemes (paint brands, battery brands, lamp brands, electronics OEMs) that fund take-back.
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5348_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5348_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5348_Task7" name="Negotiate co-funding/subvention per unit returned and data-sharing for their…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negotiate co-funding/subvention per unit returned and data-sharing for their stewardship reporting.
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: 3 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5348_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5348_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5348_Task8" name="Align with the plastic-EPR program (VS-179) to avoid double-counting and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Align with the plastic-EPR program (VS-179) to avoid double-counting and consolidate PRO coordination.
Responsible (R): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5348_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5348_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
